{"id":"f3ed0badfcd1f292","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-cohen-preserves.md","title":"Cohen Forcing Preservation","display":"thm-cohen-preserves — Cohen Forcing Preservation","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-cohen-preserves","aliases":["58-thm-cohen-preserves"],"display":"thm-cohen-preserves — Cohen Forcing Preservation","depends_on":["[[58-df-cohen]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-ctm]]","[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-cohen-preserves"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-cohen-preserves</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cohen-preserves — Cohen Forcing Preservation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"58-df-cohen\">58-df-cohen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e\" href=\"?note=1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing\">58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ffb6ae6f4ef2728\" href=\"?note=9ffb6ae6f4ef2728\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (ground model, theory, Cohen poset, order, and cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cohen}_S\\)</span> (Cohen-poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"aa69e82627a80f1e\" href=\"?note=aa69e82627a80f1e\" title=\"58-df-cohen\">58-df-cohen</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S\\)</span> (theory-relative countable-transitive-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"58-df-ctm\">58-df-ctm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span> (the ground theory contains ZFC)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\kappa]\">\\(M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\kappa]\\)</span> (internal cardinality in the ground model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S\\)</span> (ccc-forcing predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S\\)</span> (model-relative preservation predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}preserves}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,1)\\land\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in M\\;\\Bigl(M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\kappa]\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}preserves}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,1)\\land\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in M\\;\\Bigl(M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\kappa]\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Cohen forcing adds a new real but preserves all cardinals.</li>\n<li>The preservation assertion now carries the exact five arguments: ground model, theory, forcing carrier, forcing order, and internally computed cardinal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-cohen","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cohen]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"1a3c9e1f2fccfb5e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-ccc-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"9ffb6ae6f4ef2728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing12-preservation-of-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ctm]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cohen","status":"resolved","id":"aa69e82627a80f1e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cohen}_S$ (Cohen-poset predicate, see [[58-df-cohen]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ctm","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTM}_S$ (theory-relative countable-transitive-model predicate, see [[58-df-ctm]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cohen}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\kappa]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}cohen\\text{-}preserves}\\vdash\\mathrm{Cohen}_S(P,\\leq_P,1)\\land\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCccForcing}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in M\\;\\Bigl(M\\models\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(v_0)\\urcorner[\\kappa]\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12PreservationOfCardinal}_S(M,\\Gamma,P,\\leq_P,\\kappa)\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1698,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4090","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-thm-c